<title>MEXICO: Mexico livestock report, feeder export price -USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico livestock report, feeder export price -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday that around 400 head were exported into the United States at two crossing points Monday.</p>
<p>Through Laredo and Del Rio, Texas, around 200 head were sold at each point, although not enough to establish market trend prices, USDA said.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
